    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the caution part but i really don't have time for doctor appointments and blood work right now. i just want to optimize my performance. like, if i just went with something like 100mg or maybe even 200mg of elemental iron a day for a few weeks, would that be a good way to jumpstart my levels? i'm pretty healthy otherwise so i feel like i can handle a bit more than the standard RDA.",
